Third-party material:
- Molar masses are facts taken from PubChem (NCBI) and CIAAW; each is cited in data/units.json.
- UCUM code strings in data/units.json are expressions in the Unified Code for Units of Measure,
  Copyright 1999-2024 Regenstrief Institute, Inc., used under the UCUM License, Version 1.1
  (https://ucum.org/license). This repository does not include or redistribute the UCUM tables
  (ucum-essence.xml). The mapping from lab spellings to UCUM codes is LifeFrom's work, is not part of
  UCUM, and is not a units standard.

